---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Bizzon" description="How Bizzon handles tool inputs, browser storage, analytics, fonts, thumbnail requests, and contact messages." canonicalPath="/privacy">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20">
    <p class="orbit-kicker">Bizzon / site information</p>
    <h1 class="orbit-display mt-4 text-5xl text-slate-950">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">This page describes the services and storage used by Bizzon. Local tool processing does not mean that visiting the site makes no network requests.</p>
    <section class="orbit-rule mt-8 pt-8"><h2 class="orbit-display text-3xl">Tool inputs and browser storage</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">Text cleanup, counting, calculations, QR generation, data conversion, and local image conversion run in your browser. These tools do not send your pasted text or selected files to a Bizzon processing server. Copy and download actions place results on your clipboard or device.</p><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">The <a class="underline" href="/invoice-maker">Invoice Maker page</a> opens a separate app at invoice-maker-chi-lyart.vercel.app; it does not embed the invoice editor here. Opening it sends a request to that host. Its storage, retention, and network behavior need to be reviewed in that app before entering client details. Browser storage such as localStorage can persist after a tab closes; clear site data for the relevant app origin to remove it. Downloaded files and copied results must be removed separately.</p></section>
    <section class="orbit-rule mt-8 pt-8"><h2 class="orbit-display text-3xl">YouTube thumbnail requests</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">The <a class="underline" href="/youtube-thumbnail-downloader">YouTube Thumbnail Downloader</a> extracts a video ID locally, then loads preview images from img.youtube.com. These requests disclose the video ID, your IP address, and browser request information to Google. Opening an image or video link also connects to Google’s services. Their handling of those requests is described in <a class="underline" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s Privacy Policy</a>. Other URL cleanup and preview tools work on the text you enter; they do not fetch the destination page to verify it.</p></section>
    <section class="orbit-rule mt-8 pt-8"><h2 class="orbit-display text-3xl">Hosting and Vercel Analytics</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">Vercel hosts Bizzon, so page and asset requests pass through its infrastructure. The shared page layout includes Vercel Web Analytics to understand site usage, such as page views, referring sites, browser/device type, and country. It does not intentionally send tool input fields as analytics events. Vercel describes this analytics service as using no third-party cookies and collecting aggregated usage data. See <a class="underline" href="https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/privacy-policy">Vercel Analytics privacy information</a> and <a class="underline" href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-notice">Vercel’s Privacy Notice</a> for its processing practices.</p></section>
    <section class="orbit-rule mt-8 pt-8"><h2 class="orbit-display text-3xl">Google Fonts</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">Pages request Archivo and Space Mono styles and font files from fonts.googleapis.com and fonts.gstatic.com. These are external Google Fonts requests, which expose your IP address and browser request information to Google. The fonts are not hosted locally by Bizzon. See <a class="underline" href="https://fonts.google.com/faq">Google Fonts FAQ</a> for provider details.</p></section>
    <section class="orbit-rule mt-8 pt-8"><h2 class="orbit-display text-3xl">Advertising</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">Bizzon publishes an AdSense account verification meta tag and an ads.txt publisher entry. These identify the publisher account; they do not load advertisements or set advertising cookies. This version of the site does not include the AdSense ad-serving script. Advertising and any required consent controls must be configured and this page updated before ads are enabled.</p></section>
    <section class="orbit-rule mt-8 pt-8"><h2 class="orbit-display text-3xl">Contact and choices</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">If you email Bizzon, your email provider transmits your address, message, and any attachments for a response. Avoid sending passwords, confidential documents, or personal invoice examples. Use the <a class="underline" href="/contact">contact page</a> for privacy questions or requests concerning messages you sent. You can clear local site storage and control external requests through your browser settings; blocking resources may affect fonts, analytics, or thumbnail previews.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
